### Calculate BMI
POST http://localhost:8000/bmi/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "height": 173,
    "weight": 65
}

### Age Calculate
POST http://localhost:8000/age/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "birth_year": 1973
}

### Percentage Calculate
POST http://localhost:8000/percentage/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "marks_obtained": 973,
    "total_marks": 1000
}
